Assign one overall result:

PASS

No missing, inaccessible, conflicting, or invalid component was found that could prevent loading, initialization, callback resolution, trigger execution, or workflow completion.

PASS WITH WARNINGS

No confirmed blocking defect was found, but conditional or runtime-dependent risks remain.

FAIL

At least one confirmed defect can prevent the project or a production entry point from executing successfully.

NOT VERIFIED

Required source files, configuration, resources, or runtime evidence were unavailable.

REPORT COMPRESSION RULES
Audit every current module, but do not list every passing function.
Summarize passing functions and dependencies by count.
List every Critical and High finding.
Combine repetitive Medium and Low findings by root cause.
Document shared components once.
Use one menu-and-trigger table rather than separate reports.
Use one consolidated defect register.
Do not create full call graphs.
Do not create full read/write matrices.
Do not create full helper, wrapper, constant, or function catalogs.
Do not reproduce completed audit reports.
Cross-reference prior audit reports only when necessary to explain a discrepancy.
Expand execution paths only to the first missing, conflicting, or blocking component.
